---
import { friendSiteInfo } from "@/config";
import "@/styles/code-block.css";
import { Content as SiteInfo } from "./site-info.md";
import { Content as ApplicationTemplate } from "./application-template.md";
---

<section class="friend-application custom-md card-base card-plain px-5 py-7 sm:px-8 sm:py-9" aria-labelledby="friend-application-title">
  <h2 id="friend-application-title">友链申请</h2>

  <div class="application-grid">
    <div class="application-column">
      <h3>1. 我的友链</h3>
      <p>欢迎交换友链，以下是本站信息：</p>
      <SiteInfo />
    </div>
    <div class="application-column">
      <h3>2. 申请格式</h3>
      <p>请按以下格式填写信息，发送至 <a href={`mailto:${friendSiteInfo.email}`}>{friendSiteInfo.email}</a>，确认后会尽快添加。</p>
      <ApplicationTemplate />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .friend-application {
    min-width: 0;
    line-height: 1.8;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .application-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }
  .application-column {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .application-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  p {
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  a {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }
</style>
